Three things being refactored at the same time.

    [KT_*]
    
        Refers to environment variable names that begin
        with "KT_".

        All previous name are deprecated. Deprecated names 
        are set to values in new name, eg,

            export sandbox=$KT_SANDBOX
    
    [split]

        Default l
